  "description_target": {
    "ambiguity_notes": "The first row-major color-4 cell selects the source 3x3 interior by quotient-by-four coordinates. Its local row and column select the destination macro-cell. Source extraction includes the marker and every other nonzero/non-gray source cell. The output preserves every gray-5 cell globally, clears all other cells, and then writes the source pattern at the destination; this is copy-after-clear, not an in-place move.",
